#: ../../source/docs/common-vio-oak-d.rst:11 cbe1e9eb313d4cb8882db866a1cd8d64
msgid ""
"This article explains how to setup a Luxonis OAK-D camera for use with "
"ArduPilot as a substitude for a GPS allowing position control modes like "
"Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Auto to work. This solution is based on HKUST Aerial "
"Robotics Group's VINS-Fusion and Sara Lucia Contreras Ojeda’s thesis \"Robot"
" pose calculation based on Visual Odometry using Optical flow and Depth "
"map\""
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何配置 Luxonis OAK-D 相机以与 ArduPilot 配合使用，作为 GPS 的替代方案，从而支持 "
"Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto 等位置控制模式。该方案基于香港科技大学空中机器人组的 VINS-Fusion 以及 Sara Lucia"
" Contreras Ojeda 的论文《基于光流和深度图的视觉里程计机器人位姿估计》。"

